//! The `background-position-x` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
//! the initial horizontal position for each background image. The position is relative to the
//! position layer set by `background-origin`.
//!
//! Initial: 0%. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to width of background positioning area minus width of background image.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - center: Aligns the center of the background image with the center of the background position
//! layer.
//!
//! Grammar: [ center | [ [ left | right | x-start | x-end ]? <length-percentage>? ]! ]#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds-4/#propdef-background-position-x
//!
//! Author guide:
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/background-position-x
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

